d a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/fileExporter(isPresented:document:contentType:defaultFilename:onCompletion:)-8h2ag":{"title":"fileExporter(isPresented:document:contentType:defaultFilename:onCompletion:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/fileexporter(ispresented:document:contenttype:defaultfilename:oncompletion:)-8h2ag","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/fileExporter(isPresented:document:contentType:defaultFilename:onCompletion:)-8h2ag","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fileExporter","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"D","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"isPresented","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Binding","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"document","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"contentType","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UTType","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:22UniformTypeIdentifiers6UTT